{
  "_about": "Red-flag phrases for the urgent-symptom check. Matching ignores capital letters, punctuation and apostrophes. A * at the end of a word matches any ending (numb* matches numb, numbness, numbing). 'emergency' phrases tell the user to call emergency services. 'urgent' phrases pause the plan and say to see a professional first. 'strict' phrases are checked ONLY for users who chose 'I'm self-diagnosing'. They are in addition to the other two lists. Wording changes here need review by a physio or doctor before any paid launch.",
